      "review_rationale": "Rechecked HHS Chapter 7 printed page 88. Its introductory paragraph alone supports the age scope and the Most advice qualifier plus specific guidance for age groups and certain conditions. No Chapter 4 evidence is needed for this self-contained Chapter 7 answer; a cross-chapter question can compose the separate adult claim."
