      "review_rationale": "Reread actual S1 JATS paragraphs 11, 61, 62, 70 and 74 and verified each against the stored exact source version. Paragraph 61 explicitly lists load, volume, training frequency, exercise selection or duration for continuing longer-term progress. The list uses alternatives and is bounded by individualization; it is not a requirement to increase all variables together or a prescription of personal parameters. Paragraphs 62/74 retain individualized goals and group-evidence limits, and paragraph 70 retains the distinction between load and repetition tasks."
